pra:activity_RiskManagement_1 a pra:Activity ;
    rdfs:label "Liquidity Risk - maintaining liquidity buffers, access to central bank facilities and intra day credit lines Operational…" ;
    dcterms:description "Liquidity Risk - maintaining liquidity buffers, access to central bank facilities and intra day credit lines Operational Risk - robust IT systems or back up systems, regular audits, contingency planning Settlement Risk - RTGS systems or payment-versus-payment (PvP) mechanisms Systemic Risk - managing systemic risk through oversight and regulation by Central Bank/Regulators Forex Risk - hedging strategies such as forwards and options Legal & Compliance Risk - Compliance with AML/KYC Counterparty Risk - Thorough due diligence and netting arrangements Market Risk - Using Value at Risk models and stress testing Technology Risk - strong cybersecurity measures and regular system updates" .

