    dcterms:description "Provides comprehensive reporting capabilities for payment services across all domains. This function consolidates operational, compliance, and performance data from Order Management, Payment Processing, Clearing, and Settlement to deliver accurate, timely, and auditable reports. It supports regulatory obligations (e.g., PSD2, SEPA), internal governance, and customer transparency by generating structured reports (incl. statements), dashboards, and APIs for corporate clients. Reporting covers transaction volumes, SLA adherence, exceptions, fees, and settlement outcomes, ensuring full lifecycle visibility." ;
