    rdfs:label "Notification Management" ;
    dcterms:description "Notification Management is the systematic process of generating, delivering, tracking, and managing communications to relevant parties about the status, progress, critical events, required actions, or exceptions related to a payment transaction. For SEPA Direct Debit (SDD), this includes mandate-related notifications, pre-notifications to debtors, and updates throughout the collection lifecycle." ;
